# Deliberate. Every value this app reads is resolved at build time, and
# `.env` files do NOT override variables already present in the environment —
# so a committed `.env` cannot overwrite a build arg, but it CAN silently
# supply one that was forgotten, producing an image pointing at the wrong
# project with a clean build log. Keep it out of the context; the Dockerfile
# fails loudly instead.
.env
.env.local
